flowchart LR
  A[Guest message] --> B[Language and reservation]
  B --> C[Global + property-scoped retrieval]
  C --> D{Policy and knowledge gate}
  D -->|known| E[Approved answer + source]
  D -->|unknown or protected| F[Host escalation]
  D -->|emergency| G[Urgent alert + safe standby]
  F --> H[Human answer]
  H --> I[Sanitized knowledge proposal]
  I --> J[Separate human approval]
  J --> C
